meta {
  name: CRUD Flow
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Recommended test order:
  1. Health
  2. Login
  3. Get Me
  4. Logout (optional — invalidates accessToken for later requests)
  5. Create Property (building only; saves propertyId)
  6. Upsert Property Rooms (amenities + multiple rooms via PUT .../furnishings)
  7. Get Property (asserts rooms: Room 301, 302, 401)
  8. Update Property
  9. List Properties
  10. Filter by Status
  11. Delete Property (admin only)
  12. Bulk Create Properties (optional seed)
  13. Upload Property Image (requires migration 005_property_images.sql)
  14. List Property Images
  15. Create Property Utility Bill
  16. List Property Utility Bills
  17. Update Property Utility Bill
  18. Delete Property Utility Bill

  Set email and password in the local environment before running.
}
